# GitHub Linguist Configuration
# Exclude frontend JS, JSX, HTML, and CSS files from GitHub language statistics
# so Python is detected as the primary language for this repository.

frontend/** linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
*.jsx linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
package-lock.json linguist-vendored

# Explicitly ensure Python is detected
*.py linguist-detectable=true
